    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join thousands of players in a persistent world where every click matters and every cursor tells a story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CursorMMO is a real-time multiplayer resource gathering game that transforms the simple act of clicking into an engaging social experience. Watch other players' cursors move across your screen as you work together\u2014or compete\u2014to build the ultimate automated empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Shared Living World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See every player's cursor in real-time as you explore a persistent world that never sleeps. Chat, collaborate, or compete with players from around the globe while building your legacy one click at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2692\ufe0f Build Your Automated Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from wood to rare diamonds, then construct automated structures that work for you even when you're away. Place strategic pickaxes, manage your inventory, and watch your empire grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Town Center Hub</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the central marketplace to trade resources, purchase upgrades, and teleport across the world. The town center serves as your safe haven and social hub in this expansive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Strategic Territory Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your structures or raid others' automated setups. Every placement matters in this dynamic world where collaboration and competition coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcca Climb the Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress against thousands of other players. Will you become the ultimate resource mogul, or will you forge a different path to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform play ensures you never miss a beat\u2014jump in on desktop or mobile and watch your empire thrive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ready to make your mark? Your cursor awaits in CursorMMO.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join thousands of players in a persistent world where every click matters and every cursor tells a story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CursorMMO is a real-time multiplayer resource gathering game that transforms the simple act of clicking into an engaging social experience. Watch other players' cursors move across your screen as you work together\u2014or compete\u2014to build the ultimate automated empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Shared Living World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See every player's cursor in real-time as you explore a persistent world that never sleeps. Chat, collaborate, or compete with players from around the globe while building your legacy one click at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2692\ufe0f Build Your Automated Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from wood to rare diamonds, then construct automated structures that work for you even when you're away. Place strategic pickaxes, manage your inventory, and watch your empire grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Town Center Hub</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the central marketplace to trade resources, purchase upgrades, and teleport across the world. The town center serves as your safe haven and social hub in this expansive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Strategic Territory Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your structures or raid others' automated setups. Every placement matters in this dynamic world where collaboration and competition coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcca Climb the Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress against thousands of other players. Will you become the ultimate resource mogul, or will you forge a different path to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform play ensures you never miss a beat\u2014jump in on desktop or mobile and watch your empire thrive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ready to make your mark? Your cursor awaits in CursorMMO.</i></p>",
